itle":"Service Automation & Integration","description":"Intelligent connection of tools, databases, and cloud services; eliminate manual processes, reduce human error by 90%."},{"index":"004","title":"SaaS Product Design & Development","description":"From idea to MVP to scale: multi-tenant architecture, cloud infrastructure, and research-driven UX."},{"index":"005","title":"Analytics Dashboards & BI","description":"Visualize complex data with D3.js and Plotly; real-time analysis, trend prediction, executive reports for rapid decision-making."}],"ctaLabel":"request technical consultation","ctaHint":"assess project requirements"},"about":{"eyebrow":"bigblakboks / about us","kicker":"03 / team","headline":"two senior engineers, one strategic vision","lead":"bigblakboks was founded by two experienced engineers who see product design and system architecture as a unified discipline. We believe successful digital products emerge from systematic, deep thinking — not scattered, surface-level execution.","blocks":[{"label":"background","value":"founded by senior engineers"},{"label":"philosophy","value":"architecture before implementation"},{"label":"expertise","value":"from strategy to production deployment"},{"label":"collaboration","value":"full transparency, milestone-based reporting"}],"processTitle":"our methodology","process":[{"step":"01","title":"deep problem analysis","description":"before any technical decision, we root-cause the business problem and define success metrics."},{"step":"02","title":"system architecture design","description":"complete blueprint: data structures, user flows, technology selection, and scalability strategy."},{"step":"03","title":"agile development with continuous feedback","description":"deliver testable iterations in short cycles, gather feedback, and course-correct based on data."},{"step":"04","title":"deployment & long-term support","description":"cloud infrastructure setup, performance monitoring, and partnership for future growth."}],"statement":"we chose the name bigblakboks because our job is this: manage technical complexity in the underlying layers and deliver a simple, reliable, scalable outcome to you.","ctaLabel":"technical discussion","ctaHint":"free consultation"},"contact":{"title":"start collaboration","subtitle":"share your project details. our technical team responds within 24 business hours and schedules a free consultation call.","nameLabel":"full name","namePlaceholder":"your full name","emailLabel":"business email","emailPlaceholder":"name@company.com","messageLabel":"project brief","messagePlaceholder":"business objectives, technical requirements, expected timeline...","submit":"submit request","sending":"processing...","success":"request received. our technical specialist will contact you shortly.","error":"something went wrong. please try again or email us directly.","close":"cancel"},"portfolio":{"eyebrow":"bigblakboks / selected work","kicker":"04 / projects","headline":"systems we've engineered","lead":"a selection of platforms, SaaS products, and enterprise systems designed and built from the ground up. every project focuses on scalability, security, and optimized user experience.","items":[{"id":"ecommerce-platform","index":"001","title":"Enterprise E-Commerce Platform","shortDescription":"Comprehensive commerce solution with real-time inventory and automated order processing.","fullDescription":"We engineered an enterprise-grade e-commerce ecosystem optimized for high-scale operations. Through complete automation and flawless UX, we transformed a standard online shop into a 24/7 revenue-generating machine operating without manual intervention.","challenge":"Client struggled with manual inventory updates, slow checkout (60% cart abandonment), and legacy system crashes during traffic spikes. Thousands of dollars in daily lost sales.","solution":"Headless commerce architecture with Next.js for sub-2s page loads, automated inventory sync across 5 warehouses, 3-step checkout flow. Real-time analytics dashboard for complete sales visibility.","results":["60% reduction in cart abandonment","3x faster page loads (under 2 seconds)","40% conversion rate increase in first 3 months","Processed 10,000+ orders on Black Friday with zero downtime"],"technologies":["Next.js 14","Node.js","PostgreSQL","Stripe","Redis Cluster"],"category":"E-Commerce Platform"},{"id":"healthcare-dashboard","index":"002","title":"Healthcare Management System","shortDescription":"Integrated patient management connecting clinics, physicians, and pharmacies.","fullDescription":"A HIPAA-compliant healthcare ecosystem digitizing the entire patient care journey from appointment booking to prescription fulfillment. Secure bridge between medical professionals, patients, and pharmacies with end-to-end encryption.","challenge":"Clinical staff spent 20+ hours weekly on manual data entry across siloed systems. Scattered patient records, 35% no-show rate, serious data security concerns.","solution":"Unified dashboard with automated SMS/Email reminders, EHR with role-based access control (RBAC), integrated e-prescribing. Complete security audit for HIPAA compliance.","results":["20 hours saved weekly per clinic","Zero data breaches since launch (18+ months)","35% reduction in appointment no-shows","95% satisfaction among medical and administrative staff"],"technologies":["React 18","TypeScript","AWS HIPAA","MongoDB Atlas","Socket.io"],"category":"Digital Health System"},{"id":"fintech-analytics","index":"003","title":"Financial Intelligence & Market Analytics Platform","shortDescription":"Real-time financial data visualization for investment firms.","fullDescription":"Sophisticated financial intelligence platform transforming complex global market data into actionable insights. Command center for investment decisions with millisecond-level data updates.","challenge":"Analysts used 5+ disconnected tools. Data latency caused missed opportunities, custom reporting took hours, no unified view existed.","solution":"Aggregated 12+ global financial APIs into single dashboard with customizable widgets, automated PDF/Excel report generation, predictive analytics module with ML algorithms for trend forecasting.","results":["Real-time data from 12 global exchanges (NYSE, NASDAQ, LSE, etc.)","80% reduction in report generation time (5 hours to 30 minutes)","Identified $2M+ in discovered investment opportunities","Adopted by 3 investment firms with combined AUM $500M+"],"technologies":["Vue.js 3","Python FastAPI","D3.js","GraphQL","TimescaleDB"],"category":"Financial Technology (FinTech)"},{"id":"restaurant-app","index":"004","title":"Smart Restaurant Ordering System","shortDescription":"Contactless dining experience with KDS and POS integration.","fullDescription":"Progressive Web App that revolutionized the ordering process. Diners scan QR code, browse interactive menu, order and pay—all from their phone. Orders sent directly to kitchen displays.","challenge":"Restaurant chain faced staff shortages, long wait times (customer complaints), frequent order errors. Slow table turnover, suboptimal revenue.","solution":"PWA with easy QR access, direct integration with existing KDS and POS systems. Smart upselling algorithms based on order history, automatic order routing to kitchen stations.","results":["40% increase in ordering efficiency","25% faster table turnover (higher revenue per shift)","15% rise in average order value via smart upselling","90% reduction in order errors (from 12% to 1.2%)"],"technologies":["React","PWA","Firebase","Stripe Terminal","WebSocket"],"category":"Hospitality Technology"},{"id":"logistics-automation","index":"005","title":"Fleet & Logistics Management Platform","shortDescription":"End-to-end tracking, route optimization, and intelligent dispatch.","fullDescription":"Intelligent logistics command center optimizing delivery routes in real-time, tracking fleet movements globally, automating dispatch decisions. Transformed chaos into coordinated precision.","challenge":"Logistics company had zero visibility into 200+ vehicle fleet. Manual route planning inefficient, ETAs unpredictable, spiraling operational costs.","solution":"GPS-enabled system with AI-powered route optimization algorithm (25% distance reduction), automated dispatch based on driver availability and real-time traffic, customer tracking portal with accurate ETAs.","results":["25% reduction in operational costs (fuel, wear)","30% fewer late deliveries","Real-time tracking for 100% of shipments","40% decrease in customer support tickets"],"technologies":["Angular","Go","Google Maps Platform","Apache Kafka","PostgreSQL/PostGIS"],"category":"Logistics & Supply Chain"},{"id":"saas-project-tool","index":"006","title":"SaaS Project Management Platform","shortDescription":"Collaborative workspace with workflow automation and client portals.","fullDescription":"Modern project management solution for creative agencies and tech teams. Combines task management, client collaboration, and workflow automation in one intuitive platform.","challenge":"Remote teams drowned in tool fragmentation—Slack for comms, Trello for tasks, Drive for files. Context switching killed productivity, clients felt excluded.","solution":"All-in-one workspace with advanced Kanban boards, integrated time tracking, white-label client portals for full transparency, workflow automation with custom triggers.","results":["Acquired 200+ paying customers in 12 months","25% improvement in on-time project delivery","45% increase in customer satisfaction scores (CSAT)","50% reduction in weekly status meeting time"],"technologies":["SvelteKit","Node.js","GraphQL","Docker","AWS ECS"],"category":"Software as a Service (SaaS)"}],"ctaText":"Have a project in mind? Let's discuss the technical architecture and execution strategy.","ctaLabel":"request consultation session"}}